 *   - Full Node.js standard library (fs, path, child_process, etc.)
 *   - Any npm packages installed in OpenCode's environment
 *   - `context.directory` — project working directory
 *   - `context.sessionID` — current OpenCode session
 *   - `context.abort` — AbortSignal for cooperative cancellation
 *
 * ## Tool result
 *
 * Return a plain object or string. It becomes the tool's output that the LLM
 * sees in the conversation. Large outputs should be summarised — the LLM
 * context window is shared with the tool output.
 *
 * ## Overriding built-in tools
 *
 * Naming a file `bash.ts`, `read.ts`, etc. OVERRIDES OpenCode's built-in tool
 * of the same name. Use with caution — this can break the agent's fundamental
 * ability to interact with the filesystem.
 *
 * @template
 */

